  "id": "ullrichnoonan-syndrome",
  "term": "Ullrich–Noonan syndrome",
  "definition": "Ullrich–Noonan syndrome is a genetically varied biological disorder that affects growth and physical development and can include heart problems, hormonal differences, and characteristic facial and skeletal features. It occurs in males and females with a normal karyotype and may be associated with some degree of intellectual disability.",
